WEBVTT

00:00:06.347 --> 00:00:08.175
[thunderclap]

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:14.616
I have come home, Master.
我回家了 师傅

00:00:14.746 --> 00:00:17.880
This is no longer your home.
And I am no longer your master.
这不是你家 我也不再是你的师傅

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:21.840
Oh, yes.
You have a new favorite.
对哦 你收了个新爱徒

00:00:21.971 --> 00:00:24.800
So where is this Po?
你的高徒阿波在哪里？

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:27.585
[chuckles]
Did I scare him off?
我把他吓跑了吗？

00:00:27.716 --> 00:00:29.979
This battle is
between you and me.
这是你和我的决斗

00:00:30.109 --> 00:00:34.984
So, that is how
it's going to be.
原来如此

00:00:35.114 --> 00:00:37.029
That is how it must be.
没错 就是这样

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:39.989
[growling]

00:00:40.119 --> 00:00:42.078
[shouting]

00:00:51.609 --> 00:00:55.787
I rotted in jail for 20 years
because of your weakness!
你心太软 害我蹲了20年苦窑

00:00:55.918 --> 00:00:58.137
Obeying your master
is not weakness!
尊师重道绝不是软弱的表现

00:00:58.268 --> 00:01:00.923
You knew I was
the Dragon Warrior.
你明知道我就是神龙大侠

00:01:01.053 --> 00:01:03.273
You always knew.
你一直都知道

00:01:03.404 --> 00:01:08.496
But when Oogway said otherwise,
what did you do?
但乌龟说不是时 你做了什么？

00:01:09.888 --> 00:01:12.195
What did you do?!
你有替我说话吗？

00:01:14.241 --> 00:01:17.331
- Nothing!
- You were not meant
to be the Dragon Warrior!
你不是神龙大侠 那不是我的错

00:01:17.461 --> 00:01:18.593
That was not my fault!
你不是神龙大侠 那不是我的错

00:01:18.723 --> 00:01:20.638
Not your fault?!
不是你的错？

00:01:20.769 --> 00:01:22.771
Who filled my head with dreams?!
是谁让我满脑子都是梦想？

00:01:22.901 --> 00:01:24.990
Who drove me to train
until my bones cracked?!
是谁逼我练功练到断筋碎骨？

00:01:25.121 --> 00:01:28.037
Who denied me my destiny?!
是谁害我当不成神龙大侠？

00:01:36.915 --> 00:01:39.918
- It was never
my decision to make!
- [snarls]
我从来都没有权力决定

00:01:45.097 --> 00:01:46.621
It is now.
现在你有权力决定了

00:01:51.582 --> 00:01:55.238
Give me the scroll!
把神龙秘笈给我！

00:01:55.369 --> 00:01:56.935
I would rather die.
我宁死也不给

00:02:00.069 --> 00:02:02.289
[straining, grunts]

00:02:31.796 --> 00:02:35.322
[both shouting]

00:02:44.679 --> 00:02:46.724
[snarling]

00:02:46.855 --> 00:02:49.727
All I ever did,
I did to make you proud!
我练功是为了…让你…以我为荣

00:02:49.858 --> 00:02:52.687
Tell me
how proud you are, Shifu!
师傅 告诉我你以我为荣

00:02:53.601 --> 00:02:55.429
- Tell me!
- [grunting]
告诉我！

00:02:55.559 --> 00:02:57.431
Tell me!
告诉我！

00:03:07.615 --> 00:03:11.488
I have...
I have always been proud of you.
我一直都以你为荣

00:03:11.619 --> 00:03:15.405
From the first moment,
I've been...
从一开始…我就是

00:03:15.536 --> 00:03:17.842
...proud of you.
从一开始…我就是

00:03:17.973 --> 00:03:20.149
And it was my pride...
但就是这一点

00:03:20.279 --> 00:03:22.194
...that blinded me.
也让我看不清真相

00:03:22.325 --> 00:03:26.155
I loved you too much to see
what you were becoming...
我太溺爱你了
看不出你的转变…

00:03:26.982 --> 00:03:29.245
...what I...
…我把你

00:03:29.376 --> 00:03:31.465
...was turning you into.
宠成一个大坏蛋

00:03:32.117 --> 00:03:33.945
I'm...
我很抱歉

00:03:34.076 --> 00:03:35.338
I'm sorry.
我很抱歉

00:03:42.301 --> 00:03:46.262
[snarling]
I don't want your apology.
我不要你道歉

00:03:46.393 --> 00:03:48.177
I want my scroll!
我要神龙秘笈

00:03:49.918 --> 00:03:53.704
What?!
Where is it?!
什么？

00:03:53.835 --> 00:03:56.490
Dragon Warrior
has taken the scroll
秘笈早就被神龙大侠带走了
你永远得不到神龙秘笈

00:03:56.620 --> 00:04:00.407
halfway across China by now.
秘笈早就被神龙大侠带走了
你永远得不到神龙秘笈

00:04:00.537 --> 00:04:03.366
You will never see
that scroll, Tai Lung.
你永远…都得不到

00:04:03.497 --> 00:04:06.891
Never.
[straining] Never.
你永远…都得不到

